  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4811,
      "text": "Indeed, those who do not believe in the Hereafter give the angels female names.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4812,
      "text": "They have no knowledge about it. They only follow conjecture, but conjecture is of no avail against the truth.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4813,
      "text": "So pay no heed to those who turn away from Our message[11] and who only seek the life of this world.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4814,
      "text": "That is the limit of their knowledge. Indeed, your Lord knows best who has strayed from His Way, and He knows best who is guided.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4815,
      "text": "To Allah belongs all that is in the heavens and all that is on earth, so that He may recompense the evildoers for what they did, and reward those who do good with the best reward[12],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4816,
      "text": "those who avoid major sins and shameful acts, except for minor lapses. Indeed, your Lord is ample in forgiveness. He knows you best, as He created you from the earth[13] and when you were fetuses in the wombs of your mothers[14]. So do not claim purity for yourselves, for He knows best who is truly righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 461,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4817,
      "text": "Have you seen the one who turned away [from Islam],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4818,
      "text": "who gave a little, and then stopped?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4819,
      "text": "Does he have knowledge of the unseen, so he has insight[15]?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4820,
      "text": "Or has he not been informed of what is in the Scriptures of Moses,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4821,
      "text": "and of Abraham, who fulfilled his duty?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4822,
      "text": "That no bearer of burden will bear the burden of another,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4823,
      "text": "and that man will not receive except what he strives for,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4824,
      "text": "and that his efforts will be examined,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 40,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4825,
      "text": "then he will be recompensed in full,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 41,
      "juz": 27,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 527,
      "ruku": 462,
      "hizbQuarter": 211,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4826,
      "text": "and that to your Lord is the final return,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 53,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّجۡمِ",
        "englishName": "An-Najm",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Star",
        "numberOfAyahs": 62,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 42,
      "juz": 27,
